Hi Andy!

US Census does provide a unix/linux version of the binary package. I am wondering now how to solve the resulting puzzle:

- My PC runs Windows and it seems that ShinyApp runs Linux. I was thinking on having both files (windows and linux binaries) in the same folder and then make the app choose the right file according to the operating system. Is that possible?

Thanks a lot for your attention and support!

Danilo

